message: "If you use Q-Neuro or NeuroWorld, cite this software and its manuscript."
title: "Q-Neuro: ordered complex hypothesis states for synthetic diagnostic reasoning"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
authors:
  - family-names: Shafiee
    given-names: Samyar
repository-code: "https://github.com/Samyrrrrrr990/q-neuro"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - complex-valued neural networks
  - dynamical systems
  - synthetic data
  - uncertainty
  - differential diagnosis
abstract: >-
  Q-Neuro is a research-only framework for testing ordered evidence operators and evolving
  hypothesis states in the causal synthetic NeuroWorld environment. It is not clinically
  validated and must not be used for medical decisions.
